{"text":"I'm going to spend a little bit of time here just for a minute explaining to you what I mean by aid because this is one of the things that people have wanted to throw tomatoes at me for. A lot of people, in fact one NGO started a campaign against me saying I was going to kill African babies and that I wanted to stop helping many millions of African babies that are dying across the continent. In fact, I think Jeffrey Sachs even said this book has been written by a woman who doesn't have any children in rural Africa. I'm assuming he doesn't either, but maybe he'd like to tell us something. In any case, the point here being is that in the book I basically delineate three types of aid. There's emergency or humanitarian aid. So for example, think of Katrina or a flood, as in Brussels today you might be getting some aid after the floods here. Think about the tsunami or what happened in Indonesia not too long ago. But the point being that I believe as part of a global community we do have a responsibility to act wherever it may be when that type of a tragedy emerges. So my book is not about humanitarian or emergency aid.","words":[{"text":"I'm","start":0.0,"end":0.8},{"text":"going","start":0.8,"end":0.88},{"text":"to","start":0.88,"end":1.02},{"text":"spend","start":1.02,"end":1.18},{"text":"a","start":1.18,"end":1.3},{"text":"little","start":1.3,"end":1.42},{"text":"bit","start":1.42,"end":1.56},{"text":"of","start":1.56,"end":1.68},{"text":"time","start":1.68,"end":1.92},{"text":"here","start":1.92,"end":2.22},{"text":"just","start":2.22,"end":2.46},{"text":"for","start":2.46,"end":2.7},{"text":"a","start":2.7,"end":2.8},{"text":"minute","start":2.8,"end":2.96},{"text":"explaining","start":2.96,"end":3.44},{"text":"to","start":3.44,"end":3.74},{"text":"you","start":3.74,"end":3.86},{"text":"what","start":3.86,"end":3.96},{"text":"I","start":3.96,"end":4.1},{"text":"mean","start":4.1,"end":4.3},{"text":"by","start":4.3,"end":4.54},{"text":"aid","start":4.54,"end